.Dd October 23, 2026
.Dt LS 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm ls
.Nd list directory contents
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl 1la
.Op Ar file ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
list filenames in a directory, sorted alphabetically.
.Pp
the options are as follows:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl a
print all entries, including those starting with
.Dq \&. .
.It Fl l
print entries in a comprehensive format.
.It Fl 1
print one entry per line.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh BUGS
.Nm
does not yet implement:
.Fl d ,
.Fl R ,
.Fl A ,
.Fl F ,
.Fl i ,
.Fl s ,
.Fl t ,
or
.Fl r .
.Sh AUTHORS
.An juanvel400
